1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,120
Welcome to Spirits of the Wild!

2
00:00:02,439 --> 00:00:05,405
This first short video shows what the game is about.

3
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:08,332
This is a game for two players.

4
00:00:08,652 --> 00:00:10,294
Let's call them Ana and Ben.

5
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:12,615
They take turns.

6
00:00:12,935 --> 00:00:14,365
First, Ana plays.

7
00:00:15,466 --> 00:00:16,661
Then Ben plays.

8
00:00:17,366 --> 00:00:19,222
Then Ana again, and so on.

9
00:00:19,542 --> 00:00:21,121
Each go is called a turn.

10
00:00:22,233 --> 00:00:24,281
In the middle of the table is a bowl.

11
00:00:24,601 --> 00:00:26,329
It holds colorful stones.

12
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:29,523
Look at Ana's board, at the bottom.

13
00:00:29,843 --> 00:00:31,806
It shows five forest animals.

14
00:00:33,683 --> 00:00:36,371
On her turn, Ana takes a stone from the bowl.

15
00:00:36,691 --> 00:00:38,675
She gives it to one of her animals.

16
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,064
Animals give you points.

17
00:00:42,384 --> 00:00:44,112
Look at the number in the corner.

18
00:00:44,432 --> 00:00:45,584
It just went up.

19
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,750
At the end of the game, each player adds up their points.

20
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:52,076
The player with the most points wins.

21
00:00:52,396 --> 00:00:53,932
That player is the winner.

22
00:00:55,033 --> 00:00:56,718
There's a little more on the table.

23
00:00:57,038 --> 00:00:59,812
A bag, some cards, and a sneaky Coyote.

24
00:01:00,132 --> 00:01:02,457
You'll meet each of them in the next videos.

25
00:01:03,566 --> 00:01:04,462
Remember.

26
00:01:04,782 --> 00:01:06,318
Two players take turns.

27
00:01:06,638 --> 00:01:09,198
You give stones to your animals to score points.

28
00:01:09,518 --> 00:01:11,502
And the most points at the end wins.

29
00:01:11,822 --> 00:01:13,849
Next up: getting the game ready.
